Package: pulse-monitor
Version: 1.3-1
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Carlos Corral <corral1976@gmail.com>
Depends: bash (>= 4.0)
Recommends: lm-sensors, mesa-utils, pciutils, upower, x11-utils, procps
Homepage: https://gitlab.com/corral1976/pulse
Description: A minimalist and elegant system monitor for the terminal
 Pulse is a real-time system monitor featuring:
 - Dual-mode display (GUI with colors, TTY with ASCII)
 - CPU, RAM, disk, network, and temperature metrics
 - Intelligent caching for performance
 - Quiet mode for scripting and dashboards
